# CHIPSEC userspace profile: the /bin/chipsec wrapper must reach the staged
# chipsec_main.py, report the pinned 2.0.10 runtime, and enumerate the PR2945
# test module (no driver/hardware commands).
# Format: <command><TAB><Python regex expected in that command's output>.
# NOTE: the upstream banner prints "Version  :" (two spaces); \s+ matches both
# that and the single-space spelling in the lane brief.
/bin/chipsec --help	\[CHIPSEC\] Version\s+: 2\.0\.10
/bin/chipsec -lm -nb	common\.pltrst_gpio_lock
